      "id": "state-loop",
      "from": "state",
      "to": "loop",
      "variant": "dashed",
      "label": "persist · resume"
    }
  ],
  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Three boundaries",
      "items": [
        "① Inference: one token round-trip whose output cannot be assumed — the only probabilistic seam in the system.",
        "② Side effects: tools act on the world — the only boundary that changes state outside the process.",
        "③ Human: people instruct, approve, and interrupt. Authority is never fully delegated."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Out of scope",
      "items": [
        "Training, weights, inference kernels, GPU scheduling — that is the model team's world.",
        "Nor is this a collection of prompt tricks. It is about the engineering that turns a model into a system that does real work."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "One-sentence definition",
      "items": [
        "The model has no files, processes, sessions, or memory. The loop, memory, tools, safety, and UI that make it look like an agent all live in the harness."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
